# The no-network LeanUVTests.SanitizerBaseline executable reproduces these Init startup
# allocations. The raw unsuppressed report is preserved under results/.
# This does not match any allocation made by the native TCP worker callbacks.
leak:initialize_Init_
# Lean 4.35 Nat.reprFast lazily materializes USize.size (2^wordsize) as a
# persistent GMP Nat. The no-network control formats a runtime Nat and reproduces
# this exact 16-byte allocation. No native/uv.c allocation has this frame.
leak:l_Nat_reprFast
